          "Calculate $v' = 4(2x + 3)^3 \\times 2 = 8(2x + 3)^3$.",
          "Assemble by product rule: $u'v + uv' = \\frac{(2x + 3)^4}{2\\sqrt{x}} + 8\\sqrt{x}(2x + 3)^3$."
