      "solution": "$y = (2x + 1)^3(x - 5)^2$\n$\\therefore \\frac{dy}{dx} = 3(2x + 1)^2(2)(x - 5)^2 + (2x + 1)^3 \\times 2(x - 5)(1) \\quad \\{\\text{product rule}\\}\n= 6(2x + 1)^2(x - 5)^2 + 2(2x + 1)^3(x - 5)$",
      "ai_explanation": {
