          "Differentiate $u$: $u' = 3(2x + 1)^2 \\times 2 = 6(2x + 1)^2$.",
          "Differentiate $v$: $v' = 2(x - 5) \\times 1 = 2(x - 5)$.",
          "Use $u'v + uv'$: $6(2x + 1)^2(x - 5)^2 + 2(2x + 1)^3(x - 5)$."
